  "author": "robpob",
  "description": "Mejorada con el simulador del coach desde \u0022Fast Scouts \u2192 Knights\u0022, con la misma estrategia: Antes de \u0022Construir 1 campamento minero \u2192 oro\u0022: \u002B1 en madera, -1 en oro; \u0022Construir 1 casa \u2192 madera\u0022 antes que \u0022Construir 1 establo \u2192 madera\u0022. Simulada antes: Edad Feudal 7:05, Edad de los Castillos 17:10, fin 24:50, centro urbano parado 25 s. Despu\u00E9s: Edad Feudal 7:05, Edad de los Castillos 16:45, fin 24:25, centro urbano parado 0 s. Malian fast scouts, using wood bonus to go up early.  After castle age, build order shows rough roadmap to 3 stable knights, and then adding 2 TCs. If you want to create constant camels instead of knights, rule of thumb is 1 more on food \u0026 gold per stable (as creation time is lower).  After this rush to imp for farimba powerspike. Fuente: https://www.buildorderguide.com/builds/MpKkuNhdFj0HhguzSNGE.",
